# 4-Terminal Enterprise Production Logging Architecture

Implement a 4-terminal structured enterprise logging pipeline across UPBus microservices (`apps/engine`, `apps/backend`, `apps/web-app`, `apps/admin`), featuring 4 dedicated, color-coded live stream tabs in the Admin Console UI without altering any existing statistics or active bus tracking functionality.

## Proposed 4-Terminal System Architecture

```
                                  ┌───────────────────────────┐
                                  │   UPBus Admin Console     │
                                  │   (4 Terminal Log Window) │
                                  └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                                                │ Polling / SSE
                                                ▼
                                  ┌───────────────────────────┐
                                  │  Backend Admin Monitor    │
                                  │   (Central Log Collector) │
                                  └─────────────▲─────────────┘
                                                │ HTTP Push Bridge
             ┌──────────────────┬───────────────┴───────────────┬──────────────────┐
             │                  │                               │                  │
┌────────────┴──────────┐ ┌─────┴──────────────────┐ ┌──────────┴──────────┐ ┌─────┴────────────┐
│ Terminal 1: Engine    │ │ Terminal 2: Admin      │ │ Terminal 3: Web-App │ │ Terminal 4:      │
│ (GPS, Snapping, ETA)  │ │ (Audit, Overrides)     │ │ (User Activity)      │ │ API Gateway      │
└───────────────────────┘ └────────────────────────┘ └──────────────────────┘ └──────────────────┘
```

